  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8b8a544771773f64ab5c363b1575c05258609227.png\" alt=\"擴展戰鬥：鐵魔法與咒術書 相容插件標題圖片\" width=\"500\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fec-irons-spells-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156927/description_cb892b5a-2e64-45b9-b4d4-708a821fcd42.png\" alt=\"Modrinth頁面\" width=\"187\" height=\"64\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a7bff26028f093d51d9da01e07e384f91f63ae13.png\" alt=\"Cloth Config API 必要依賴\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5aec5c41ae6f0aac946a80fe3cf688a7a336fa09_0.webp\" alt=\"Curios 必要依賴\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/59e9eeade55f309be535f0b860f0219c8863d4b0_0.webp\" alt=\"擴展戰鬥 必要依賴\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/38e9e9f3ffd9c1cde9e3107883981af4f67928bb.png\" alt=\"鐵魔法與咒術書 必要依賴\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">擴展戰鬥</a>開發的插件模組，新增與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火之歌：龍之時代</a>的相容性。</p>\n<h3>新增以下材質的護手裝備：</h3>\n<p>遠古喚魔師, </p>\n<p>寒冰術士, </p>\n<p>邪教徒, </p>\n<p>雷電法師, </p>\n<p>獄髓戰法師, </p>\n<p>瘟疫使者, </p>\n<p>祭司, </p>\n<p>烈焰術士, </p>\n<p>稻草人, </p>\n<p>暗影行者,</p>\n<p>以及流浪法師</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>點擊橫幅獲取優惠：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fuserofbricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/91cdbb92-a3db-4f62-a182-239fe5589b2a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting 優惠宣傳\"></a></p></div></div>",
